      },
      "text_or_visual_description": "Vertical flowchart: Self -> DRC expresses itself (Through symbols, culture and craft) -> Other -> Curiosity is created = searches begin (People look for answers, they dig deeper) -> Synthesis -> Conversations spread -> Cultural understanding (People now begin to understand beyond stereotypes and headlines) -> Relationships built (Trust grows, connections form. Whether locally or internationally) -> Opportunity is unlocked (Tourism, trade, investment, collaboration, influence)",
